WEBVTT

00:08.300 --> 00:15.500
Omoi wo ima hanadete hatenai asu ni kazasu yo

00:08.300 --> 00:15.500
I now play my feelings,
out to the endless tomorrow!

00:15.540 --> 00:22.250
Setsunai hodo mune utsu kagirinai kibou

00:15.540 --> 00:22.250
This unbounded hope that beats in my breast
to the point of melancholy

00:23.050 --> 00:30.850
Hakanasa wo masu hibi wo
irodoru wa kisetsu no kaze

00:23.050 --> 00:30.850
The days pass by, becoming more fleeting,
colored by the season's wind

00:30.890 --> 00:35.560
Kioku no kakera ga sawagidashita yo

00:30.890 --> 00:35.560
The fragments of memory started running wild

00:36.160 --> 00:44.560
Arinomama wo mitomete
haruka tsumuida hikari ga

00:36.160 --> 00:44.560
One more time, I want to hold the
spindle of far off light close to my breast,

00:44.610 --> 00:52.240
Kieru mae ni mou ichido
kono mune ni dakishimete

00:44.610 --> 00:52.240
Before it disappears, before
I accept the way things are now

00:54.320 --> 01:01.520
Omoi wo ima hanadete hatenai asu ni kazasu yo

00:54.320 --> 01:01.520
I now play my feelings,
out to the endless tomorrow!

01:01.520 --> 01:08.660
Mirai wo egaku ao ni kono te wo nobashite

01:01.520 --> 01:08.660
Hold out this hand to the blue-painted future

01:08.830 --> 01:15.960
Kasokushiteku sekai yo douka
yasashii mama de ite

01:08.830 --> 01:15.960
The world accelerates, please let it stay this kind

01:16.070 --> 01:23.570
Setsunai hodo mune utsu afuredasu negai

01:16.070 --> 01:23.570
This overflowing wish that beats in my breast
to the point of melancholy

02:00.720 --> 02:01.920
Are you okay?

02:01.920 --> 02:04.220
I'm sorry for worrying you.

02:04.220 --> 02:07.390
But my body doesn't seem to be able to take it.

02:07.390 --> 02:09.260
Should I try and wake your mother?

02:09.520 --> 02:12.820
No, I think I'll be okay...

02:13.700 --> 02:14.590
I'm sure...

02:20.240 --> 02:21.260
Ichika...

02:24.810 --> 02:26.910
Then I won't eat, either!

02:26.910 --> 02:28.240
Manatsu...

02:28.910 --> 02:30.740
Time for a diet!

02:37.720 --> 02:38.650
I've got an email...

02:38.720 --> 02:40.250


02:40.260 --> 02:41.560
It's from Keiko...

02:41.560 --> 02:43.650


02:46.260 --> 02:48.830
Would you like to come too, Manatsu?

02:48.830 --> 02:49.630
You sure?

02:49.630 --> 02:55.160
Yes. Please watch over me and
make sure I don't do anything strange...

02:59.070 --> 03:00.780
Please, Ichika.

03:00.780 --> 03:02.640
Don't look at me like that.

03:03.480 --> 03:06.310
It's true that I came out from the mirror...

03:06.780 --> 03:08.280
That's suspicious, isn't it?

03:08.280 --> 03:11.780
I think you've also realized
that my body isn't normal, too...

03:12.090 --> 03:15.650
Even if I am someone suspicious,
I still want to be...

03:16.360 --> 03:18.120
...your friend, Ichika.

03:19.130 --> 03:20.860
Manatsu...

03:22.700 --> 03:24.830
Just for this summer...

03:25.200 --> 03:26.730
Let me be your friend.

03:27.740 --> 03:28.700
Please.

03:29.670 --> 03:34.080
It seemed like Manatsu still had something
she was hiding from me.

03:34.080 --> 03:37.510
Well, the same could be said for myself.

03:38.650 --> 03:43.150
The Pain of Love

03:43.620 --> 03:46.590
Well then, we're heading out Ma'am!

03:50.530 --> 03:52.320
Saya...

04:01.400 --> 04:04.900
A cicada? It looks like its body is caught.

04:05.240 --> 04:09.700
Watching that cicada struggle, I couldn't help it...

04:10.080 --> 04:15.350
I had a feeling that it was similar
to how I was at the time.

04:16.520 --> 04:17.450
Ichika?

04:20.890 --> 04:22.480
You do your best as well.

04:22.860 --> 04:24.090
Let's go.

04:24.090 --> 04:24.650
Sure.

04:28.300 --> 04:30.490
It's so loud!

04:32.400 --> 04:33.600
Good morning!

04:33.600 --> 04:35.400
Good morning to you.

04:35.400 --> 04:36.900
Huh? Where's Keiko?

04:36.910 --> 04:38.600
It looks as if she is not here yet.

04:39.070 --> 04:41.510
And it was her that called us out!

04:41.910 --> 04:43.640
Here she comes! That's got to be her.

04:53.990 --> 04:55.460
I'm sorry...

04:55.460 --> 04:57.220
You're late, late!

04:58.230 --> 04:59.520
We made it!

05:28.890 --> 05:32.260
This thing seems really slow...

05:32.590 --> 05:34.890
Isn't it better to take things easy?

05:35.300 --> 05:36.130
There's the ocean.

05:41.900 --> 05:43.910
The road is backed up.

05:43.910 --> 05:45.960
This way's way quicker!

05:47.080 --> 05:50.140
Manatsu, kids are going to laugh at you.

05:55.380 --> 05:57.320
How cute of them.

05:57.990 --> 05:58.820
Rui...

06:00.120 --> 06:02.890
That's my little sister Rui.

06:03.590 --> 06:04.990
What's this?

06:04.990 --> 06:06.430
Maybe we should cool their jets!

06:06.430 --> 06:07.500
Please do not.

06:07.500 --> 06:08.930
Why not?

06:09.230 --> 06:13.270
She saved up her allowance all for this day.

06:13.270 --> 06:14.900
Oh, good for her.

06:17.410 --> 06:19.670
Let's leave them be.

06:20.040 --> 06:20.670
Okay?

06:21.140 --> 06:22.510
Roger!

06:23.550 --> 06:26.250
Enoshima is the stop after next.

06:26.250 --> 06:28.720
Right. The one after next.

06:29.420 --> 06:31.410
It seems like we are going to the same place.

06:32.320 --> 06:38.560
I am sorry, but since I do not want to
interfere with them, I will go home now.

06:39.830 --> 06:41.350
Then, take care!

06:47.540 --> 06:50.000
Ichika?

06:56.540 --> 06:58.810
I hope that was my imagination.

07:11.030 --> 07:13.430
Four more...

07:18.630 --> 07:20.400
But wait, is this okay?

07:21.340 --> 07:23.770
If you're going all the way to Enoshima,

07:23.770 --> 07:26.540
isn't there someone more appropriate
for you to go with?

07:31.050 --> 07:32.040
I love you...

07:32.580 --> 07:33.570
No, there isn't.

07:34.750 --> 07:36.480
What about Nozomu?

07:37.750 --> 07:40.050
He hasn't contacted me.

07:41.390 --> 07:47.730
Even if I call him or send him email,
all I get is "beep, beep, beep".

07:52.030 --> 07:56.700
It must be because of my family.

07:57.510 --> 07:58.600


08:13.660 --> 08:15.090
Keiko, that's...

08:15.860 --> 08:21.230
If that's not it, then it must be my fault...

08:26.940 --> 08:31.870
It's always us kids that get
dragged around by the adults!

08:38.810 --> 08:40.180
Tough, isn't it?

09:15.580 --> 09:17.240
So, let's go!

09:19.650 --> 09:21.520
Roger!

09:31.800 --> 09:34.390
Four middle school tickets, please.

09:34.700 --> 09:36.640
Here, four adults.

09:49.880 --> 09:52.180
You're not going to eat, Ichika, Manatsu?

09:52.490 --> 09:54.360
I'm not hungry at all.

09:54.360 --> 09:56.320
I'm not hungry at all!

09:57.630 --> 09:59.820
Are you on a diet?

10:00.860 --> 10:03.520
It's not too late! So...

10:07.240 --> 10:08.170
Yes...

10:09.870 --> 10:12.070
It's not too late...

10:17.580 --> 10:22.480
How sad... She can no longer stomach anything.

10:35.030 --> 10:36.330
Did I make it?

10:54.920 --> 10:57.080
So this "rock house" is a cave?

10:57.390 --> 10:58.620
Aren't you scared?

10:58.620 --> 11:02.860
It's fine! I went in here when
I was in elementary school.

11:02.860 --> 11:03.980
It's no big deal.

11:07.330 --> 11:09.300
I don't wanna...

11:24.750 --> 11:29.020
The god here can bless
your future success in love!

11:29.020 --> 11:32.480
And how does that help
when it's only us girls that came?

11:32.990 --> 11:34.790
It's okay.

11:34.790 --> 11:37.960
As long as you have someone you are tied to,

11:37.960 --> 11:41.760
I believe your wish will be heard.

11:43.430 --> 11:45.370
Then, those kids, too.

11:53.840 --> 11:55.640
That should do.

11:57.610 --> 11:59.440
Thank you very much.

12:03.050 --> 12:05.250
I wonder what they wished for?

12:05.250 --> 12:07.290
Don't look!

12:07.290 --> 12:08.780
Oh, come on...

12:12.330 --> 12:13.890


12:14.960 --> 12:16.930


12:17.930 --> 12:20.630


12:27.310 --> 12:29.940
Wow, sure is hot!

12:29.940 --> 12:31.500
Yeah, hot!

12:47.930 --> 12:50.630
Finally, cooled off a bit.

12:50.630 --> 12:52.600
Seriously.

12:53.600 --> 12:55.070
It's over here, I think.

12:56.400 --> 12:58.270
"Lover's Hill."

13:01.880 --> 13:03.940
What are all these locks?

13:03.950 --> 13:07.710
Lovers write their names on them
and lock them here.

13:08.280 --> 13:10.290
The same as those ema from before.

13:10.290 --> 13:12.650
Connected... Tied to one another.

13:13.420 --> 13:14.720
Never to be separated.

13:15.160 --> 13:16.650
That's what it's a wish for.

13:17.590 --> 13:18.030


13:18.030 --> 13:23.030
Today's date... Nozomu?

13:25.900 --> 13:29.200
That's got to be another person, I'm sure.

13:31.240 --> 13:33.170
Oh, Nozomu!

13:34.680 --> 13:38.210
Give it back, I'm not done with it!

13:38.210 --> 13:40.200
Come on, just a bit more.

13:40.950 --> 13:42.640
No fair!

13:45.990 --> 13:46.820
Let's go.

13:54.730 --> 13:55.930
What is it?

13:55.930 --> 13:56.620
Friends of yours?

13:56.930 --> 13:58.130
Y-yeah...

13:58.930 --> 14:00.870
Let's head back, okay?

14:01.240 --> 14:03.840
Hey Nozomu, that hurts!

14:03.840 --> 14:04.900
Minami...

14:06.110 --> 14:10.340
Wait, is that the girl with those parents?

14:12.080 --> 14:13.340
Keiko...

14:22.420 --> 14:23.910
What the hell was that?

14:26.660 --> 14:29.490
Why did you do that to Nozomu?

14:30.400 --> 14:32.870
You uncivilized clod! I hate violent people!

14:32.870 --> 14:34.200
Stop it, Minami.

14:34.200 --> 14:35.030
Let's go.

14:36.000 --> 14:37.660
Farewell.

14:51.850 --> 14:53.590
I'm sorry, Keiko.

14:53.590 --> 14:56.720
He's just... such an idiot.

14:56.720 --> 14:58.360
It's okay.

14:58.360 --> 15:00.230
You see, I...

15:04.330 --> 15:06.320
This was sent to the wrong person?

15:07.500 --> 15:08.670


15:08.670 --> 15:12.570
I'm sorry. I was too scared
to go check by myself.

15:12.570 --> 15:17.510
That's why I had everyone come with me.

15:18.050 --> 15:18.940
I'm sorry.

15:22.150 --> 15:24.620
But I feel better now.

15:25.820 --> 15:28.650
What is this sensation?

15:34.500 --> 15:35.620


15:37.400 --> 15:39.920
Keiko's voice?

15:44.340 --> 15:45.430
Ichika?

15:48.580 --> 15:49.480
Ichika!

15:53.350 --> 15:55.980
You can no longer see with just your eyes.

16:00.020 --> 16:04.750
Your ears, and mouth, and nose as well...

16:05.830 --> 16:07.090
And...

16:08.260 --> 16:09.350
Don't!

16:10.600 --> 16:13.730
No!

16:19.010 --> 16:20.060
Ichika!

16:36.960 --> 16:38.050
Ichika!

16:45.930 --> 16:49.200
Is it... too late?

17:07.260 --> 17:08.380
Yousuke...

17:18.800 --> 17:20.060
Huh?

17:20.330 --> 17:23.170
Hello? Hello, Minami?

17:23.170 --> 17:25.470
Nozomu? Nozomu?

17:29.280 --> 17:31.850
The bonds between people...

17:31.850 --> 17:36.370
Do you seriously think those electric creations
can connect people?

17:37.550 --> 17:38.350
Ichika...

17:40.490 --> 17:44.820
I... I've gone and done it again!

17:47.700 --> 17:49.790
My pacemaker...

17:50.300 --> 17:51.560
Stop it!

17:52.170 --> 17:55.570
It's no use! The backup generator is down!

17:55.570 --> 17:56.560
Stop it!

18:00.580 --> 18:02.130
Stop it!

18:03.480 --> 18:05.640
It looks like a power outage.

18:11.820 --> 18:12.840
Keiko?

18:15.490 --> 18:18.420
It's okay to cry, right?

18:19.860 --> 18:24.130
Just while the power is out...

18:28.000 --> 18:29.830
It's always...

18:31.170 --> 18:37.810
It's always us kids that...
get dragged around by the adults...

19:03.640 --> 19:04.800
I was too late.

19:12.380 --> 19:13.750
That's...

19:13.750 --> 19:15.110
Those kids are...

19:22.860 --> 19:26.730
Don't worry. I'm here with you.

19:28.130 --> 19:30.720
But... But I'm...

19:32.200 --> 19:34.130
I'm going to transfer schools!

19:35.040 --> 19:37.130
I'm going to transfer...

19:56.120 --> 19:59.290
I... I...

19:59.630 --> 20:02.060
I... I...

20:02.360 --> 20:03.390
Ichi...

20:16.280 --> 20:19.540
Are you crying, Ichika?

20:20.350 --> 20:22.320
Sei?

20:22.320 --> 20:23.650
Why?

20:23.650 --> 20:26.350
But my eyes are...

20:28.320 --> 20:29.620
You can borrow these.

20:31.460 --> 20:33.790
Thank you very much.

20:40.470 --> 20:42.490
He's quite the cheat.

20:42.940 --> 20:44.940
But, just barely gets away with it.

20:44.940 --> 20:46.600
Not a violation of the rules.

20:50.980 --> 20:53.980


20:53.980 --> 20:57.850


20:57.850 --> 21:01.580


21:01.860 --> 21:06.360


21:10.200 --> 21:13.460


21:25.580 --> 21:32.450
I started to lose faith in myself... To fear myself.

21:32.990 --> 21:35.150
I was already...

21:41.130 --> 21:44.430
Ichika, I'm going to tell you the truth...

21:45.900 --> 21:47.060
I'm.

21:47.430 --> 21:50.400


21:51.210 --> 22:00.770
Ano hi deawanakereba ima mo
waraeteta no ka na?

21:51.210 --> 22:00.770
If we hadn't met that day,
would I have still been able to laugh now?

22:02.150 --> 22:13.650
Ano hi nakushita egao itsuka tokeru namida

22:02.150 --> 22:13.650
The smile I lost that day,
the tears that one day melt away...

22:19.170 --> 22:28.940
Hora kotoshi mo ame furu gogo
hakanai utakata no iro

22:19.170 --> 22:28.940
See, this year the afternoon rain falls again
in the color of fleeting bubbles

22:30.010 --> 22:38.850
Sora mo yasashiku mienai wa
datte hitori da mono

22:30.010 --> 22:38.850
The sky doesn't look kind to me, after all,
I'm alone

22:40.490 --> 22:45.490
Itazura na sadame ni kotoba mo denai wa

22:40.490 --> 22:45.490
I have no more words for the tricks of fate

22:45.890 --> 22:53.290
Wakariaeta futari ni mou modorenai no?

22:45.890 --> 22:53.290
Can we never return to two
who understood each other?

22:53.870 --> 23:03.470
Ano hi deawanakereba ima mo
waraeteta no ka na?

22:53.870 --> 23:03.470
If we hadn't met that day,
would I have still been able to laugh now?

23:04.850 --> 23:16.550
Ano hi nakushita egao itsuka tokeru namida

23:04.850 --> 23:16.550
The smile I lost that day,
the tears that one day melt away...

23:20.390 --> 23:21.700


23:21.700 --> 23:25.300
People are never truly alone...

23:25.600 --> 23:30.100
On that day I came to realize
that if you turn around,

23:30.770 --> 23:33.970
there will surely be someone
behind you watching over you.

23:34.780 --> 23:39.980
On the next Uta~Kata:
Reunion Beyond the Grave
